type: software
title: "Classifying ovarian cancer from serum proteomics with random Boolean network attractors"
abstract: "A classifier that runs each serum mass spectrum through a random Boolean network and learns from the attractor it reaches, compared with a random forest on the NCI ovarian cancer data."
